--         |(mkTables P R s t α).dd u| ≤ 2 ^ (P + R + 2) ∧
--         ∀ c, |(mkTables P R s t α).am c u| ≤ 2 ^ (P + R + 2) ∧
--           |(mkTables P R s t α).ap c u| ≤ 2 ^ (P + R + 2)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Chunk-table sizes 1: every entry of `mkTables` is `≤ 2^(P+R+2)`
--
--   From `mkTables_ok` (on a one-block partition with `st = c`, `len = λ`): each entry is within
